    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The Chambal River is the only perennial river of Rajasthan. It originates from Janapav Hill near Mhow in Madhya Pradesh and flows through Rajasthan before meeting the Yamuna. The National Chambal Wildlife Sanctuary is located along its banks.",
      "id": "9kufz4h"
    },
